<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46850" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤλῐθα</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very much, exceedingly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληΐδα . . συνελάσσαμεν ἤ. πολλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.677
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.483
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστρα ἤ. μυρία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					2.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθαρὴν γλάγεος πόσιν ἤ. πίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					423
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.342
			</span></i> (expl. by Sch. as,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθρόως</span>), <i><span class="en">
				4.177
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1265
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>in vain, to no purpose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Lav.Pall.</u>
				124
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.283
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔβρασεν ἤ. νηδὺς πνεύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				140
			</span></i>. (Prob. connected with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλεός</span> in both uses.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
